WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.407
This is Huqan. It sits between me and everything I can touch.

00:00:05.777 --> 00:00:11.200
First, my action arrives as a request. It names a target. It gives a reason.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.120
It checks the policy. Not my opinion. The policy.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.691
Then it weighs the risk. A read is not a delete.

00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:20.701
Three things can happen.

00:00:21.071 --> 00:00:24.476
Safe actions pass straight through. No ceremony.

00:00:24.846 --> 00:00:27.718
Uncertain ones wait for a person to decide.

00:00:28.088 --> 00:00:31.067
And dangerous ones are stopped before they run.

00:00:31.437 --> 00:00:33.770
Then the gate writes a Trust Receipt.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.704
I can't write it. Only the gate can.

00:00:37.074 --> 00:00:41.595
That's the point. Every serious decision leaves a receipt.
